  "description": "The world of mountain biking is exploding with Young Talent, and the JEFFSY PRIMUS 26 is here to champion it. Developed for riders between 145cm and 160cm tall, it’s a YT through and through and a sure-fire hit with any rising trail superstar. From the shred-ready SRAM drivetrain to the Maxxis Minion tires, there are no compromises here – this is a hard-hitting ride that’s every bit as capable as its big brother JEFFSY! The RockShox suspension is easily adjustable to suit a range of rider weights and provides 140mm of rut-chomping suspension travel in the front and rear. The sturdy SUNRinglé wheels stay true for overcooked sends and sideways landings, and a 100mm Postman dropper boosts standover for rowdy descending.",
